        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ecru cotton. Central design includes, below, a view of the town of Yaroslavl, and above, an elaborate crest bearing the inscription 1834 and an inscribed ribbon. Between the ribbon and the city flies an eagle bearing a wreath. A wide border with design of vine scrolls and figures. A few stains and small holes."@en ;
